      "title": "B. P. Capital Limited Announces Executive Changes, Effective from 21 January, 2026",
      "body": "B. P. Capital Limited board of Directors of the Company in its meeting held on 21 January, 2026 Considered and approved, upon the recommendation of the Nomination & Remuneration Committee, the appointment of Mr. Faizal Bavaraparambil Abdul Khader (DIN: 07729191), as an Additional Director (Non-Executive/Non Independent) of the Company with immediate effect, i.e., w.e.f. 21 January 2026. Mr. Fazal Bavaraparambil Abdul Khader is a committed & motivated business owner with almost 18 years of experience in manufacturing, trading of plywood, spices, resins and petrochemical and distribution of electronic products. He is experienced in managing all aspects of business development and possesses excellent leadership skills and considered and accepted the resignation of Mr. Rachit Garg (DIN: 075741",
